"screenshot-4-environment-station.png", "id": "982933147479863", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_982933150813196_1098495751667877981_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7QATNI5QEfoQ7kNvwHwPXfw&_nc_oc=AdqdVKp9gsWk1iMdjtvUY3bDxJpHkBljr1zY1qxHIVvbYo9sNuWpMQT5xQpq-4Mzx1I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQdC17AmqQbJ-SeX1rH0hZydHYD6fOMz7v7JQraZPFTwg&oe=6AF5CC8A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-environment-cabin.png", "id": "1524763559413134", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300725_1524763562746467_764910693733824437_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ihFVUZXn4xMQ7kNvwExmPBz&_nc_oc=AdoL9aHTALCY0bQcDNTyDZfTnP1Wp5PzYYivHVRfkM1kmQkj5ReeL9Vrb9m0lmHs4AY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQbibBrvSG2pQNAD7dqI50OxyaG_kp5S5ql-1APPVGxSA&oe=6AF5F401"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "JellyTheatre", "keywords": ["jellyfin", "media", "movie"], "long_description": "JellyTheatre turns your Meta Quest into a private cinema for your Jellyfin\nmedia server. Sign in with a Quick Connect code (no typing), pick a film and\nwatch it on a giant screen.\n\nPLACES TO WATCH\n- A movie theatre with dimming lights and a screen that lights up the room\n- A home cinema, a lakeside cabin with a crackling fire, the Cupola of a space\n  station floating above the planet, a dark void\n- Your own room in passthrough, with a screen you can place anywhere\n\nYOUR LIBRARY, IN SYNC\n- Continue watching, next up, new movies and shows, favourites, search\n- Seasons and episodes with thumbnails and watched marks\n- Your progress and watched status go back to Jellyfin, so you can pick up on\n  any other device\n\nGENTLE ON YOUR SERVER\n- Plays your files directly whenever the headset can, so your server doesn't\n  have to convert them\n- Shows whether a film plays directly or is being converted\n\nMADE FOR WATCHING\n- Subtitles (text and Blu-ray PGS) with size, style, position and timing\n- Skip intro and credits, chapters, seek bar previews, up-next episodes\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n- A Jellyfin server reachable over HTTPS\n- A Jellyfin account on that server\n\nJellyTheatre is an independent project, not affiliated with the Jellyfin\nproject. It does not provide any content: it plays the media on your own\nserver.\n\nScreenshots show Blender Foundation open movies (Tears of Steel, Sintel,\nCaminandes and others), CC BY, \u00a9 Blender Foundation, studio.blender.org.", "short_description": "Watch your own Jellyfin library on a giant screen: a movie theatre, a home cinema, a lakeside cabin, a space station or your own room in passthrough."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://jellytheatre.vpelloin.eu/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "vpelloin", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/valentinp72/JellyTheatre/issues", "website_url": "https://jellytheatre.vpelloin.eu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4689010294716446"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4529080493972628"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4529080493972628"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792086240, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4529080493972628"}]}, "liveChannel": 